            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Breastfeeding"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "哺乳及断奶羔羊阶段不计时，从后续有效转群记录起算；转出再转回累计各段日期差，不以出生或建档日期代替。无产羔且无胎次记录按零胎；已有胎次以记录为准。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Time in the nursing and weaned-lamb stages is excluded. Counting starts at the next valid transfer. If a sheep leaves and returns, the days in each stay are added. Birth and registration dates are not substitutes. With no lambing or parity record, parity is counted as zero. Otherwise, the recorded parity is used."
