        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The actual date of weight must be filled in; 24 hours are counted as birth and more than 24 hours as normal. Unclaimed weight can be left blank at the same time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填写你自己的 OpenAI API Key。连接测试会产生少量 API 用量；通过后单独保存在本机钥匙串。" : {
