    "将修改" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Will change"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将停止相关任务并核对回执；已经执行的牧场业务记录会保留。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Related tasks will stop and receipts will be checked. Farm records already created will be retained."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Will delete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除“%@”及其成员关联，该批次将不再用于批次分析。羊只及其称重、治疗等生产记录会保留，原成员可加入其他批次。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deletes “%@” and its membership links and removes it from batch analysis. Sheep and their production records, including weights and treatments, are retained. Former members can join other batches."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将同期发情、放栓、打针和配种等步骤保存为可复用方案。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save simultaneous estrus, thrombus release, injection, and breeding steps as reusable options."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将在 %lld 天后达到 %lld 日龄，尚无有效断奶记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In %lld days, reaches %lld days of age; no valid weaning record yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将恢复批次及删除时的全部成员关系；如果羊只已加入其他进行中的批次，撤回会暂停并提示处理冲突。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Restores the batch and all membership links as of deletion. If any sheep has joined another active batch, the reversal pauses so you can resolve the conflict."
