    "正常销售" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Normal sales"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正式发布前必须将主体、地址、隐私负责人和邮箱占位符替换为真实信息。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The controller, address, privacy owner, and email placeholders must be replaced with real information before official release."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正式日均只计算截至昨天的完整自然日；晚补录转群、离场、投喂或盘槽后会按事实时间重新计算。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Official daily averages use only complete calendar days through yesterday. Late entries for transfers, departures, feedings, or bunk readings are recalculated using their actual event times."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正式本地库已经存在相同迁移牧场，但没有完整提交凭据。请先检查本地数据。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The same moving pastures already exist in the official local bank, but they are not submitted in full. Please check local data first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正数增加、负数减少；余额不能小于 0。调整只影响 TMR 成品账，不改动原料库存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Positive Increase, Negative Decrease; Balance cannot be less than 0. The adjustment only affects the TMR finished product account, and does not change the ingredient inventory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此 iPhone" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此入口仅用于尚未建立 Next 牧场的首次完整迁移。已有牧场请从“录入 → 合并 eSheep+ 投喂”进入，只追加缺失投喂，不得用完整备份覆盖当前牧场。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use this entry point only for the first complete migration into a new Next farm. For an existing farm, choose “Record → Merge eSheep+ Feedings” to append only missing feedings; never overwrite the current farm with a full backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此入口会直接扣减每种原料库存，不形成 TMR 成品批次。需要先制锅、再分顿或跨日投喂时，请使用 TMR 流程。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This entry directly deducts each ingredient from inventory and does not create a finished TMR batch. Use the TMR workflow when you need to mix a batch first, split it across feedings, or feed it over multiple days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此操作会撤销登录与共享关系，且无法撤销。若你仍拥有牧场，系统会要求先处理这些牧场。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This will undo the login and sharing relationship and cannot be undoed. If you still own a farm, you'll be asked to deal with them first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此检查只读取旧版导出包并生成迁移前报告，不会修改旧版数据，也不会写入当前牧场。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This check only reads legacy export packages and generates pre-migration reports, does not modify legacy data, and does not write to the current farm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此模板版本暂不支持。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This template version is not supported."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此牧场尚未发布可用快照。完成登录与云端牧场加载后会自动更新。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No snapshot has been published for this farm yet. It will update automatically after sign-in and the cloud farm has loaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此羊舍有关联业务或历史记录，不能删除；清空后可以停用，全部历史仍会保留。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This pen has linked activity or historical records and cannot be deleted. You can deactivate it once empty. Its full history will be retained."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此聊天只读取和操作当前牧场。业务操作继续使用操作卡确认，已执行记录不会随聊天删除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This chat can access only the current farm. Farm operations are confirmed on action cards. Deleting the chat preserves completed farm records."
          }
        }
      }
    },
