            "value" : "Directly calls the App authoritative export interface to generate files. xlsx is the current ranch Excel workbook,backup is the full recoverable JSON backup, template is the full-function Excel entry template. The tool successfully represents only the generated file and still requires the user to select a location in the system save panel."
