    "系统" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "System"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统以出生后、断奶前最早一条实际称重为起点自动计算；断奶表不填写初生重和日增重。没有有效称重时不计算。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The system is automatically calculated using the first physical weight before weaning at birth as the starting point; the weaning form does not fill in new and growing weights. Do not count when no valid weighing is available."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统会先生成完整备份并校验全部记录与照片。切换过程中断后会从安全断点继续。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The system will first generate complete backup and verify all records and photos. After the switching process is interrupted, it will continue from the safe breakpoint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统会在下次前台恢复时继续，不会把当前半成品设为云端权威。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The system will continue the next time the front desk is restore and will not set the current semi-finished product as the cloud authority."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统会按来源校验补齐缺失的投喂及明细，并刷新云端基线。已有业务记录不会重复，eSheep+ 不会被修改。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The system completes the missing feed and detail by source and updates the cloud baseline. Business records are not duplicated and eSheep+ is not modified."
          }
        }
      }
    },
